  "decision_conditions": [
    "By reason of its design and siting, the proposed illuminated digital display and communications kiosk would be harmful to the free flow of pedestrian movement on this part of London Road resulting in harm to highway and pedestrian safety, would fail to adhere to the principles of accessibility and local permeability in the locality. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the principles of the NPPF, Policy T2 of the London Plan 2021, Policy 36 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018, and Sutton's Urban Design Guide 'Creating Locally Distinctive Places' SPD."
  ],
